00:29:44.324 --> 00:29:46.240
Like I don't know if
it's big data, but it's--

00:29:46.240 --> 00:29:47.399
FELIPE HOFFA: It's a lot.

00:29:47.399 --> 00:29:48.190
It's a lot of data.

00:29:48.190 --> 00:29:51.230
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Yeah, so it
