00:29:57.670 --> 00:29:59.630
FELIPE HOFFA: With
BigQuery it takes seconds.

00:29:59.630 --> 00:29:59.910
FRANCESC CAMPOY: Really?

00:29:59.910 --> 00:30:00.640
FELIPE HOFFA:
Really, really fast.

00:30:00.640 --> 00:30:01.130
FRANCESC CAMPOY: That's cool.

00:30:01.130 --> 00:30:03.470
FELIPE HOFFA: I had the
ability to sit down with her--

00:30:03.470 --> 00:30:06.060
FRANCESC CAMPOY: And tell her
