FRANCESC CAMPOY: With a T?

00:31:31.690 --> 00:31:32.020
Wow.

00:31:32.020 --> 00:31:33.020
MARK MANDEL: That's
a lot of data.

00:31:33.020 --> 00:31:34.480
That's-- yeah, that's big data.

00:31:34.480 --> 00:31:36.142
FRANCESC CAMPOY: OK.

00:31:36.142 --> 00:31:38.600
FELIPE HOFFA: Anyone could go
and play with these datasets.

00:31:38.600 --> 00:31:41.190
Also, Hacker News, if you
