00:32:11.530 --> 00:32:14.004
Reddit /r/BigQuery.

00:32:14.004 --> 00:32:14.920
MARK MANDEL: BigQuery.

00:32:14.920 --> 00:32:15.840
Awesome.

00:32:15.840 --> 00:32:16.500
